===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|quethen}}, {{m|enm|cwethen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cweþan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*kweþaną}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*[[Reconstruction:Proto-Indo-European/gʷet-|gʷét]]-||to say, speak}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|kweede||to say, speak, tell}}, {{cog|da|kvæde}}, {{cog|is|kveða||to say}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/kwiːð/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-quethe.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|iːð}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|quethes|quething|quethed|past2=quoth|past3=quod|quethed|past_ptc2=quethen}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete|_|except in past tense [[quoth]]}} To [[say]] or [[declare]].
#* '''1845''', [[w:Edgar Allan Poe|Edgar Allan Poe]], “[[s:The Raven (Poe)|The Raven]]”
#*: '''Quoth''' the raven, “Nevermore.”

